hority support ID-first reads; describe fixing the incarnation and keep session/destination limits. The inherited core preparation comment about a null production capability port and the extents publish-hold comment also need reconciliation with current wiring. These are documentation follow-ups, not new authorization defects or grounds to close existing88503049.\n\nThe newly opened R1 revision20 commission22fc1a93/promise cdc93e34 is design work only and is not reviewed or adopted. This snapshot's basis remains adopted R1r19/R26/R2r15. Its proposed observed-subject/publication-reservation forms confer no current source credit. All remaining I3, IA/I4/I5/E1, full application/browser/CLI/agent customization, all5capacity/platform maxima, final receipt/publication, live host/runner/storage/Worker/device/recovery/clock/deployment and retained custody/form duties remain owed. Estimates remove no functionality.\n\nValidation limits: immutable native Git, builtin static text/hash/count and /tmp evidence plus normal gitseq only. Checker and readers ran no project code/imports/tests/gate/build/install/typecheck/evaluator/simulation/private diagnostics/provider/process/deployment work and changed no source/Git refs. Forbidden cloud-review scripts and static-ledger bodies were not opened or run. Authored tests and producer control claims were read as static evidence only; this preliminary report carries no gate/execution credit. Root's normal M3 approval must wait for its actual complete source delivery, binding and required producer gate.","body":{"base":"c404c8d8bca71c1beb0a11dc21c86c0ddcb5a52d","changed_paths":"58","formal_approval":"false","head":"441727709eb65abb813ef95124fb5a8c72ef232d","read_seal_sha256":"e28dd7eee9167c0871f243634ba5c52c49a61c2b6b87f7676eadbf3aeeddc628","review_scope":"preliminary-static-only","tree":"5dff7d9c959fbfa2eb2108aa62c9c54f7a207afd"}}